Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.35,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}You’re running {\c&H006DDCFF&}third{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.35,0:00:02.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Nobody passes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:04.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}You finish {\c&H006DDCFF&}fourth{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.16,0:00:05.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}How the fuck does that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.19,0:00:06.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}work? Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:08.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}You counted the runners.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.21,0:00:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Should’ve counted the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:10.31,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}passengers too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:12.24,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}England, twenty eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.78,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The Kielder Marathon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:15.18,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Twenty-six miles around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}a reservoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Everyone’s running the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:18.12,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}same programme:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:18.76,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}left foot,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:19.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}right foot,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:21.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}repeat. Rob Sloan’s version
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:22.33,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}apparently included a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:23.10,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}window seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.96,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}According to the organisers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:25.82,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}he covered part of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:27.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}course on a spectators’
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:28.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}{\c&H006DDCFF&}bus{\r}. Imagine trusting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.55,0:00:29.79,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}British public transport
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.79,0:00:30.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}enough to stake your fucking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.87,0:00:32.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}personal best on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.12,0:00:33.22,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Near the finish,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:34.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Sloan is running again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:35.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}He comes {\c&H006DDCFF&}third{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.67,0:00:37.24,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Five hundred and fortieth?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:38.94,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Maybe nobody asks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:40.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Third? You’ve just appointed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:42.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}one extremely sweaty bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:43.84,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}to investigate you personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:45.79,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}That man was Steve Cairns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.79,0:00:47.35,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}He knew he’d been {\c&H006DDCFF&}third{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.35,0:00:48.37,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}To lose a place,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.37,0:00:49.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}somebody had to pass him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:50.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Think of him replaying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.87,0:00:52.10,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}every vest he saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:53.37,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Probably didn’t memorise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.37,0:00:54.29,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}the arse end of a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.29,0:00:54.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}{\c&H006DDCFF&}bus{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:00:56.32,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Officials annulled Sloan’s
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:58.32,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}result. Cairns got {\c&H006DDCFF&}third{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:01:00.14,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Sloan later denied cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:01.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Even this bloody story
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:03.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}comes with a return service.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:04.79,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}That’s the beauty of running.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:05.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}All you need is shorts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.87,0:01:06.81,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}and trainers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.81,0:01:08.24,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Although before you board,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}do ask the driver:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:10.34,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}does this fucker stop at
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:10.98,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}the podium?
